      "field": "abilities",
      "content": [
        {
          "skill_id": 52700,
          "type": "Passive",
          "name": "Xuanyong Line of Defense",
          "desc": "Passive: The damage received when the skill hits the enemy or during the defensive posture will become the troop strength. The maximum troop strength is 1000~4500. Charged slam will add 20% physical damage to the troops. Charged slam when the troops are at full strength can also cause an additional 20% damage and (8% lost health) recovery. Defensive posture: Basic attack consumes all troops to strengthen into a charged slam, causing 40 (+ 100% physical attack) physical damage. Charge can accumulate troops. During the charging period, it can reduce damage from the front by 10%, become immune to control, and gain an additional 100% of troops. If Meng Tian is damaged during this period, it will cause a 90% deceleration effect on the target in front, lasting 0.5 seconds.",
          "cd": "0",
          "cost": "0",
          "tags": [
            "Damage Reduction",
            "Pierce",
            "Buff"
          ],
          "icon": "https://game.gtimg.cn/images/yxzj/img201606/heroimg/527/52700.png"
        },
        {
          "skill_id": 52701,
          "type": "Skill 1",
          "name": "Phalanx Thrust",
          "desc": "Charge in the designated direction, causing 200/240/280/320/360/400 (+70% physical attack) physical damage to enemies on the path. At the end of the charge, the target in front will be knocked back and a large number of troops will be added. During the charge, you can use [defense as offense] to interrupt the charge process. Defensive stance: No longer charges, cannot repel the enemy, but the skill cooldown is greatly reduced, and the direction of defense can be changed. After hitting the enemy, the cooldown time of the second skill is reduced by 2/2.4/2.8/3.2/3.6/4 seconds.",
          "cd": "10/9.6/9.2/8.8/8.4/8",
          "cost": "0",
          "tags": [
            "Movement",
            "Knock Back",
            "Damage"
          ],
          "icon": "https://game.gtimg.cn/images/yxzj/img201606/heroimg/527/52710.png"
        },
        {
          "skill_id": 52702,
          "type": "Skill 2",
          "name": "Use defense as offense",
          "desc": "Meng Tian raises his shield and steps into a defensive posture, knocking back surrounding enemies and causing 100/120/140/160/180/200 (+35% physical bonus) points of physical damage. Release again to release the defensive stance and increase movement speed by 50% for 1 second. Defensive stance: Reduces damage from the front by 20%.",
          "cd": "6",
          "cost": "0",
          "tags": [
            "Defense Stance",
            "Shield",
            "Damage Reduction"
          ],
          "icon": "https://game.gtimg.cn/images/yxzj/img201606/heroimg/527/52720.png"
        },
        {
          "skill_id": 52703,
          "type": "Skill 3",
          "name": "Xuanyong generals",
          "desc": "Meng Tian summons 4 Xuanyong soldiers to fight with him for 20 seconds. The soldiers rush towards Meng Tian from four directions, causing 125 (+100% physical attack) physical damage to enemies on the path and slowing down for 1 second (determined in real time based on the percentage of Meng Tian's military strength value, up to 90%) and increasing a large number of troops. The soldiers followed General Meng Tian to the death, attacking and releasing skills with Meng Tian. Xuanyong's soldiers have their own attributes (bonded by Mengtian's various attributes). When this skill is released again, Meng Tian will command the soldiers to switch formations. When switching to the square formation, Meng Tianjun can reduce the damage from the front by an additional 20%. Defensive posture: Xuan Yong soldiers will enter a defensive posture together with Meng Tian.",
          "cd": "40",
          "cost": "0",
          "tags": [
            "Summon",
            "Formation",
            "Burst"
          ],
          "icon": "https://game.gtimg.cn/images/yxzj/img201606/heroimg/527/52730.png"
        },
        {
